<tr class="mktoModule" id="Title_Of_the_Third_Copy6fe55aea-028b-4bad-a553-308347ebbec1"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#ffffff"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_ptrl2" style="padding:38px 40px 0px 40px;"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:24px; line-height:26px; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color:#223341; padding-top:5px; font-weight:bold;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_096fe55aea-028b-4bad-a553-308347ebbec1" class="mktoText"> 
<p>International Payment Plans Now Available<br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:15px;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_0106fe55aea-028b-4bad-a553-308347ebbec1" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: left;">Flywire is thrilled to expand our Payment Plan offering to now support international payment methods for students and institutions worldwide!<br /><br />Why offer Flywire’s payment plans to your international students?<br /></p> 
<ul style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"> 
<li>50% increase in plan enrollment</li> 
<li>24x7 self-service account access</li> 
<li>40% reduction in call volume</li> 
</ul> 
<p style="text-align: left;">If you haven't already seen Flywire's international payment plans in action, you can do so in our "Delivering with Confidence: International Payment Plans" webinar,&nbsp;which is now available on-demand.&nbsp;<br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#48B985; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:17px;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_0116fe55aea-028b-4bad-a553-308347ebbec1" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/on-demand-webinar-delivering-with-confidence-international-payment-plans?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank"><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/on demand webinar.png" alt="on demand webinar.png" height="50" width="200" /></a></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
